#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-make.rst:5
#: dc2fa594732c4928828b904fe1dfb9a8
msgid "Archived: Building for Pixhawk on Windows with Make"
msgstr "归档：在 Windows 上使用 Make 为 Pixhawk 构建"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-make.rst:9
#: 4df038c7c9bd4987bb7fa0f2ea2c7635
msgid "**ARCHIVED ARTICLE**"
msgstr "**已归档文章**"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-make.rst:11
#: f364d16fc5c84d0fb3e0b615d207fdd1
msgid "ArduPilot no longer supports make."
msgstr "ArduPilot 不再支持 make。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-make.rst:13
#: 490923dce9eb4e6ead4ba77cfeefbfa2
msgid ""
"This article shows how to build ArduPilot for The Cube, Pixhawk, PixRacer on"
" Windows with *Make*.  These instructions assume you have already "
":ref:`setup the build environment <building-setup-windows>`"
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何在 Windows 上使用 *Make* 为 The Cube、Pixhawk、PixRacer 构建 "
"ArduPilot。这些说明假设你已经 :ref:`搭建好构建环境 <building-setup-windows>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-make.rst:17
#: 5b07761f9e124fe880d91765bac20a83
msgid ""
"The commands for building Pixhawk are (``make px4-v2``). Building for The "
"Cube is the same except ``make px4-v3`` is used. Building for Pixracer is "
"the same except ``make px4-v4`` is used.  For the older (obsolete) PX4 use "
"``make px4-v1``."
msgstr ""
"构建 Pixhawk 的命令为 (``make px4-v2``)。构建 The Cube 相同，但使用 ``make px4-v3``。构建 "
"Pixracer 相同，但使用 ``make px4-v4``。对于旧版（已淘汰的）PX4，使用 ``make px4-v1``。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-make.rst:20
#: 697f30521f7f443e982fd590e8dab739
msgid "Build instructions"
msgstr "构建说明"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-make.rst:22
#: a59d9dfc03da4748ab6a3c7a9500cd4b
msgid "Open the *PX4Console* and navigate to the target vehicle directory:"
msgstr "打开 *PX4Console*，切换到目标飞行器目录："

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-make.rst:24
#: 640e468e168a44d58b042e380da1e0ca
msgid ""
"Start the *PX4Console*. This can be found under **Start \\| All Programs \\|"
" PX4 Toolchain** (Windows 7 machine) or you can directly run "
"**C:\\\\px4\\\\toolchain\\\\msys\\\\1.0\\\\px4_console.bat**"
msgstr ""
"启动 *PX4Console*。可在 **开始 \\| 所有程序 \\| PX4 Toolchain**（Windows 7 机器）下找到，或直接运行 "
"**C:\\\\px4\\\\toolchain\\\\msys\\\\1.0\\\\px4_console.bat**。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-make.rst:27
#: 22b0a4a165d24cfd8075d6eda8d0c5ac
msgid ""
"Navigate to the vehicle-specific ArduPilot directory in the *PX4Console*. "
"For example, to build Copter, navigate to:"
msgstr "在 *PX4Console* 中切换到特定飞行器的 ArduPilot 目录。例如，构建 Copter，切换到："

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-make.rst:35
#: 52b7dd6643cf4ef489571edd17c96c68
msgid "Build the firmware by entering one of the following commands:"
msgstr "输入以下命令之一构建固件："

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-make.rst:38
#: 5439426bab85432db2ce0e230189fa1f
msgid "``make px4-v2``"
msgstr "``make px4-v2``"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-make.rst:38
#: bec7e7fe876547dca0231efb5c965470
msgid "Build the Pixhawk firmware for a quad"
msgstr "为四旋翼构建 Pixhawk 固件"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-make.rst:41
#: edf5e83a57c14864926f7d89b87716f7
msgid "``make px4-v3``"
msgstr "``make px4-v3``"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-make.rst:41
#: bde1500579e2477286c48a89985d8c7e
msgid "Build The Cube firmware for a quad"
msgstr "为四旋翼构建 The Cube 固件"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-make.rst:44
#: 782df1c34e0b44a38e65178b972224f2
msgid "``make px4-v4``"
msgstr "``make px4-v4``"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-make.rst:44
#: 6a13307040db4987b4c1d35d3b59a047
msgid "Build the PixRacer firmware for quad"
msgstr "为四旋翼构建 PixRacer 固件"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-make.rst:46
#: c1b64155e817459fa8648ba6ff691837
msgid "``make px4``"
msgstr "``make px4``"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-make.rst:46
#: be438f54c0cd4c999716a3c222a47db0
msgid "Build both PX4 (obsolete) and PixHawk firmware for a quadcopter"
msgstr "同时构建 PX4（已淘汰）和 PixHawk 四旋翼固件"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-make.rst:49
#: 464be5ce1abe495cbe65dfed1030718f
msgid "``make clean``"
msgstr "``make clean``"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-make.rst:49
#: f9e63c3e2684483db99207e1f6d0ae31
msgid "\"clean\" the ardupilot directory"
msgstr "「清理」ardupilot 目录"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-make.rst:51
#: da65dfca1f0a4b4985cc179be8ffc052
msgid "``make px4-clean``"
msgstr "``make px4-clean``"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-make.rst:51
#: 9243421f6a1a4ae0be2268a596356ab2
msgid ""
"\"clean\" the PX4Firmware and PX4NuttX directories so the next build will "
"completely rebuild them"
msgstr "「清理」PX4Firmware 和 PX4NuttX 目录，使下次构建完全重新生成"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-make.rst:55
#: cd79b1309e0f4f5f8ba4e85649b5bd59
msgid "``make px4-cleandep``"
msgstr "``make px4-cleandep``"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-make.rst:55
#: ac6a54d1be844e9badc4e0550dc8791e
msgid ""
"\"clean\" .d and .o files from the PX4Firmware and PX4NuttX directories. "
"faster but less complete rebuild compared to \"px4-clean\""
msgstr "「清理」PX4Firmware 和 PX4NuttX 目录中的 .d 和 .o 文件。比「px4-clean」更快但不够彻底。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-make.rst:60
#: 78b30e2059754e509259114bf8a0abee
msgid "``make px4-v2-upload``"
msgstr "``make px4-v2-upload``"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-make.rst:60
#: 6be3379aa7424a0eb4ed760ea264b48c
msgid ""
"Build and upload the Pixhawk firmware for a quad (i.e. no need to upload "
"using a ground station)"
msgstr "为四旋翼构建并上传 Pixhawk 固件（即无需使用地面站上传）"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-make.rst:66
#: 3bcaeee542694f08915a8475ba8043d4
msgid ""
"The firmware will be created in the **ArduCopter** directory with the "
"**.px4** file extension."
msgstr "固件将在 **ArduCopter** 目录中以 **.px4** 扩展名创建。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-make.rst:73
#: 5ee13ca3a0a6428fb138e50bb891e976
msgid ""
"Upload the firmware using the *Mission Planner* **Initial Setup \\| Install "
"Firmware** screen's **Load custom firmware** link"
msgstr ""
"通过 *Mission Planner* **Initial Setup \\| Install Firmware** 界面的 **Load "
"custom firmware** 链接上传固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-make.rst:78
#: 7b646fbde2214d018e92414a8eebd8dc
msgid ""
"ArduPilot imports addition projects (`PX4Firmware "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/PX4Firmware>`__, `PX4NuttX "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/PX4NuttX>`__, `uavcan "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/uavcan>`__) as *git submodules* when you build"
" the project. If you built the project before the change to submodules you "
"may get errors. See :ref:`Git Submodules <git-submodules>` for "
"troubleshooting information."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 在构建项目时将 `PX4Firmware "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/PX4Firmware>`__、`PX4NuttX "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/PX4NuttX>`__、`uavcan "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/uavcan>`__ 等附加项目作为 *git 子模块* "
"导入。如果你在切换到子模块之前就已构建过项目，可能会遇到错误，请参阅 :ref:`Git 子模块 <git-submodules>` "
"以获取故障排查信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-make.rst:88
#: 96c2a542824c4c1c9ea3a40251f45440
msgid ""
"You can ignore any mesages regarding PX4Firmware and PX4Nuttx hashes. Those "
"are useful labels for developers but optional and sometimes the build system"
" can't find them on your system. As long as it says \"Firmware is in..\" "
"followed by a .px4 file then you have a successful build which you can "
"safely load onto your aircraft."
msgstr ""
"可以忽略关于 PX4Firmware 和 PX4Nuttx "
"哈希的消息，这些只是对开发者有用的标签，是可选的，构建系统有时无法在你的系统上找到它们。只要输出中出现「Firmware is in..」后跟 .px4"
" 文件，说明构建成功，可以安全地烧录到飞行器上。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-make.rst:91
#: ff2ecb6fd3384c4f9ab5d1437e855064
msgid "Hints for speeding up compile time"
msgstr "加快编译速度的技巧"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-make.rst:93
#: 9fee72ac14224a5cb09c5e6f6f55c5c1
msgid ""
"Anti virus protection is likely to slow the compile times especially for PX4"
" so it is recommended that the folders containing the ArduPilot source code "
"is excluded from your virus protections real-time scan."
msgstr "杀毒软件保护可能会显著降低编译速度，尤其是对于 PX4，因此建议将包含 ArduPilot 源码的文件夹排除在杀毒软件的实时扫描之外。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-make.rst:97
#: b2db159728af49d0a7892e48a262447d
msgid ""
"The first scan after a ``make px4-clean`` will be very slow as it rebuilds "
"everything"
msgstr "``make px4-clean`` 后的首次扫描会非常慢，因为需要重新构建所有内容。"
